  // of the radius alone still puts a visible split on anything two thirds out,
  // which is where the foliage lives. At full strength this is under half a
  // pixel of separation in the corners and none at all inside them — the bar
  // has no visible aberration anywhere in frame, and a fringe that announces
  // itself on a leaf edge is the artefact, not the lens.
